{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.variational_equations","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.variational_equations","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.variational_equations","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.variational_equations","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L48-L112","doc":"**Manuscript statement** (full body):\n\nLet $\\mathfrak{S}_q$ be the\n([categorical action](#def\\:categorical-action)).  The three variational\nequations are:\n\n1. *Gravity (vary $\\int_A$)*:\n   $\\delta\\mathfrak{S}_q / \\delta\\!\\int_A = 0$ yields the\n   *categorical Einstein equation*:\n\n   $$\n     R_{\\int} - \\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathrm{tr}(R_{\\int})\\mathrm{id}_A\n     =  T_q[\\nabla, \\psi],\n   $$\n\n   where $T_q$ is the stress-energy endomorphism constructed from the\n   gauge and matter terms.\n\n2. *Gauge (vary $\\nabla$)*:\n   $\\delta\\mathfrak{S}_q / \\delta\\nabla = 0$ yields the\n   *categorical Yang--Mills equation*:\n\n   $$\n     \\nabla \\star_q F_\\nabla + q \\cdot [F_\\nabla, \\star_q F_\\nabla]\n     =  J_\\psi,\n   $$\n\n   where $J_\\psi = \\psi^* \\otimes D_\\nabla\\psi - D_\\nabla\\psi^* \\otimes \\psi$\n   is the matter current.\n\n3. *Matter (vary $\\psi$)*:\n   $\\delta\\mathfrak{S}_q / \\delta\\psi = 0$ yields the\n   *categorical transport equation*:\n\n   $$\n     D_\\nabla\\psi =  0.\n   $$\n\n```tex\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:variational-equations-diagram}\n\\begin{tikzcd}[row sep=2.5em, column sep=3em]\n  \\mathfrak{S}_q \\ar[r, \"\\delta/\\delta\\!\\int_A\"]\n    \\ar[d, \"\\delta/\\delta\\nabla\"']\n    \\ar[dr, \"\\delta/\\delta\\psi\"]\n  & R_{\\int} - \\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathrm{tr}(R_{\\int})\\mathrm{id} = T_q \\\\\n  \\nabla \\star_q F + q[F, \\star_q F] = J_\\psi\n  & D_\\nabla \\psi = 0 \\ar[from=ul, crossing over]\n\\end{tikzcd}\n\\qquad\\text{(variational equations)}\n\\end{equation}\n```\n\n    The Lean encoding below *names* the residual proposition as a\n    `def … : Prop` over the manuscript context — the conjunction of\n    the three variational equations: (i) categorical Einstein\n    `R_∫ − ½ tr(R_∫) id_A = T_q`, (ii) categorical Yang–Mills\n    `∇⋆_q F + q·[F, ⋆_q F] = J_ψ`, and (iii) categorical transport\n    `D_∇ ψ = 0`.  Naming the conditional conjecture is honest per §3b;\n    an instance discharging it (none here) would be the conjecture,\n    the open state being the absence of one. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:variational-equations","label":"prop:variational-equations","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/variational-equations.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.zero_A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.zero_A","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L46-L46","doc":"Zero element of `EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.D_psi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.D_psi","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Matter section `D_∇ ψ : EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.J_psi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.J_psi","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Matter current `J_ψ : EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.YM_LHS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.YM_LHS","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Yang–Mills LHS `∇⋆_q F + q·[F, ⋆_q F] : EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.sub","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Subtraction on `EndA` (categorical action provides this as the\nabstract additive structure). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.T_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.T_q","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Stress-energy endomorphism `T_q[∇, ψ] : EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.R_int_trace_half","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.R_int_trace_half","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Half-trace endomorphism `½·tr(R_∫)·id_A : EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.R_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.R_int","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Ricci-like endomorphism `R_∫ : EndA`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.q","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.EndA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.EndA","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Categorical action `S_q` (abstract). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.VariationalEquationsContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.VariationalEquationsContext","kind":"class","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/variational_equations.lean#L18-L46","doc":"Abstract context for the `variational_equations` claim — the\nmanuscript-themed typed fields the three sub-claims range over.\nThe residual `Prop` (the conjunction of the categorical Einstein,\nYang–Mills, and transport equations) is *named* by\n`variational_equations` below (§3b: naming a conditional\nconjecture is not a logical claim), not faked by projecting\n`claim_*` fields. ","signatureChunk":0}]}